OL,5,G0900 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,6,     FIt's birthing season on Jackie
OL,7,     FBarlow's alpaca farm. And after
OL,8,     FJulian turns up just in time to
OL,9,     Fsee one baby born, it's the cria
OL,10,     Fwho arrived yesterday that needs
OL,11,     Fhis help.
OL,12,G1000 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,13,     FRottweiler cross Adol could maybe
OL,14,     Fhave a career as a sniffer dog -
OL,15,     Fhe's found what seems to be bag of
OL,16,     FClass A drugs. But his owner
OL,17,     FMatthew is worried that Adol's
OL,18,     Featen a second bag.
